# `plugin.conf` is the plugin manifest (id/name/enabled defaults) that
# `common.plugins.discover_dir` requires for discovery. Seeding is
# idempotent (manual Settings UI edits win), so we ship the file
# instead of gitignoring it. Users that want a local-only override
# can `git update-index --skip-worktree core/src/plugins/<id>/plugin.conf`.

# Extensions self-ignore via an in-folder `.gitignore` containing `/*`.

# Local isaac CLI state (per-user)
.isaac/
